  "🌳 #6 Best Lake Cruise": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[0]/span[3]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 6
  },
  "📍 Wannsee pier (S Wannsee)": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[0]/a[0]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 8
  },
  "2.7k+ reviews · 2 sites": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[2]/div[0]/details[0]/summary[0]/span[2]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 4
  },
  "7 Lakes, No City": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[0]/summary[0]/span[0]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 4
  },
  "<strong>A loop through the south-western Havel lakes:</strong> Kleiner Wannsee, Pohlesee, Stölpchensee, Griebnitzsee, Glienicker See and Jungfernsee, back to Wannsee.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">Villas, Babelsberg Palace and the Heilandskirche in Sacrow along the way.</span>": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[0]/div[1]",
   "seen": 2
  },
  "5 Min from S Wannsee": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[1]/summary[0]/span[0]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 4
  },
  "<strong>The pier is a 5-minute walk from Wannsee station</strong> (S1, S7 and regional trains), about 25 minutes from the centre.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">Combine it with a walk on Peacock Island or in the Grunewald.</span>": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[1]/div[1]",
   "seen": 2
  },
  "€10.80 per Hour": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[2]/summary[0]/span[0]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 4
  },
  "<strong>€18.90 for about 1 hour 45 minutes.</strong> Food and drinks are sold on board.": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[2]/div[1]",
   "seen": 2
  },
  "for a calm, green half-day out of the city for under €20.": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-6/div[0]/div[1]/div[4]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 2
  },
