   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-7/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[0]/summary[0]/span[0]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 6
  },
  "<strong>The only cruise here that goes east:</strong> under the Oberbaumbrücke into the Osthafen, past the East Side Gallery, the Molecule Man and the arena.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">It also covers the centre: Berliner Dom, Humboldt Forum, Reichstag and Hauptbahnhof.</span>": {
