   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-7/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[1]/summary[0]/span[0]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 4
  },
  "<strong>German and English over the speakers</strong>, plus an audio guide in Spanish, French, Italian, Russian, Polish and Hebrew.": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-7/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[1]/div[1]",
   "seen": 2
  },
