   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-7/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[2]/summary[0]/span[0]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 4
  },
  "<strong>Board at the Alte Börse pier</strong> opposite Burgstraße 27, next to Friedrichsbrücke and Museum Island, a few minutes from S Hackescher Markt.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">Arrive 15 minutes early to swap your ticket for a boarding pass.</span>": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-7/div[0]/div[1]/div[3]/details[2]/div[1]",
   "seen": 2
  },
  "to see the East Side Gallery and Oberbaumbrücke from the water.": {
   "source": "de page vs EN 7d212528 card-7/div[0]/div[1]/div[4]/text()[0]",
   "seen": 2
  },
